{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0085-s005", "text": "Elevens vårdnadshavare ska ansöka om rätt till avgiftsfri skolskjuts hos skolan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024942139111+0000-11/hb-c08-u0085-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.3162841796875, "generation_seconds": 22.98371409997344, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0086-s001", "text": "Eleverna ska uppföra sig sakligt mot lärare och andra elever.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024942139111+0000-11/hb-c08-u0086-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.31182861328125, "generation_seconds": 17.753518684068695, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0086-s002", "text": "Alla skolor har ordningsregler.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024942139111+0000-11/hb-c08-u0086-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.39154052734375, "generation_seconds": 12.732821265002713, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0086-s003", "text": "Med hjälp av dem bibehålls ordningen på skolan, förlöper studierna smidigt och blir skolgemenskapen trygg och trivsam.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024942139111+0000-11/hb-c08-u0086-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.24, "peak": 0.3416748046875, "generation_seconds": 32.24056371487677, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0086-s004", "text": "Det är bra om också skolvägen är så säker som möjligt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024942139111+0000-11/hb-c08-u0086-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.154829931972789, "peak": 0.291900634765625, "generation_seconds": 15.239165224833414, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0087-s001", "text": "Skolorna har en elevvårdsplan som beskriver bland annat hur skolan följer upp elevernas och skolgemenskapens välbefinnande, hälsa och säkerhet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024942139111+0000-11/hb-c08-u0087-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.26013605442177, "peak": 0.309051513671875, "generation_seconds": 41.18924099090509, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0087-s002", "text": "Planen inkluderar skolans handlingsprinciper för plötsliga kriser och hotfulla och farliga situationer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024942139111+0000-11/hb-c08-u0087-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.281341552734375, "generation_seconds": 31.80755067593418, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0088-s001", "text": "I skolorna accepteras inte diskriminering, mobbning, trakasserier eller våld.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T024942139111+0000-11/hb-c08-u0088-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.29888916015625, "generation_seconds": 22.728859732160345, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
